    "detailed_description": "&quot;Yasai Game&quot; is a falling object puzzle game that incorporates physics calculations. Players can evolve yasais by dropping different types of yasais into boxes and making them come into contact with each other. A total of 24 types of yasais appear, and the game can be cleared by making the cabbages and pumpkins touch each other.<br><br>A characteristic mechanic of the game is that combos occur when yasais evolve in a short period of time, and by making combos happen continuously, &quot;helper&quot; appear that are advantageous for gameplay. This helper character will stir up the Yasais in the box, giving you a chance to turn the game around once and for all.<br><br>&quot;Yasai Game&quot; has a time attack element where you aim to clear the game in a short time, a high score element where you aim to get the highest score, and a challenge element where you compete to see how far you can evolve your yasais. These can be competed on online leaderboards.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846980/extras/b45a04e4a05ac5663f3ccc0857eff359.avif?t=1712478234\" width=600 height=480 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Yasai Game&quot; is a falling object puzzle game that incorporates physics calculations. Players can evolve yasais by dropping different types of yasais into boxes and making them come into contact with each other. A total of 24 types of yasais appear, and the game can be cleared by making the cabbages and pumpkins touch each other.<br><br>A characteristic mechanic of the game is that combos occur when yasais evolve in a short period of time, and by making combos happen continuously, &quot;helper&quot; appear that are advantageous for gameplay. This helper character will stir up the Yasais in the box, giving you a chance to turn the game around once and for all.<br><br>&quot;Yasai Game&quot; has a time attack element where you aim to clear the game in a short time, a high score element where you aim to get the highest score, and a challenge element where you compete to see how far you can evolve your yasais. These can be competed on online leaderboards.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846980/extras/b45a04e4a05ac5663f3ccc0857eff359.avif?t=1712478234\" width=600 height=480 /></span>",
    "short_description": "This is a physics puzzle game where you stack up vegetables to harvest larger ones. You become a farmer and drop a yasai into the box. When yasais stick together, they evolve into larger yasais. Harvest your cabbage or squash before the box gets too hot.",
